sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Клиент (браузер)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant WSM as ConnectionManager
    participant TR as TaskRuntime
    participant Redis as Redis

    Client->>API: WS /ws/{client_id}
    API->>WSM: connect(websocket, client_id)
    WSM->>WSM: active_connections[client_id] = websocket
    API-->>Client: WebSocket соединение установлено

    Client->>API: POST /api/process-video/{client_id} {url, topic, level}
    API->>Redis: SET task:{task_id} {status: pending, progress: 0, client_id}
    API->>TR: enqueue({task_id, client_id, url, topic, level})
    API-->>Client: HTTP 200 {task_id, status: started}

    Note over TR,Redis: Воркер обрабатывает задачу асинхронно

    TR->>Redis: SET task:{task_id} {progress: 5, step: downloading}
    TR->>WSM: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 5, step: downloading})
    WSM->>Client: JSON {type: progress, progress: 5, step: downloading}

    TR->>Redis: SET task:{task_id} {progress: 20, step: downloaded}
    TR->>WSM: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 20, step: downloaded})
    WSM->>Client: JSON {progress: 20, step: downloaded}

    TR->>Redis: SET task:{task_id} {progress: 60, step: transcribed}
    TR->>WSM: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 60, step: transcribed})
    WSM->>Client: JSON {progress: 60, step: transcribed}

    TR->>Redis: SET task:{task_id} {progress: 85, step: extracted}
    TR->>WSM: send_progress(client_id, {progress: 85, step: extracted})
    WSM->>Client: JSON {progress: 85, step: extracted}

    TR->>Redis: SET task:{task_id} {progress: 100, status: completed}
    TR->>WSM: send_progress(client_id, {type: completed, questions_count: N})
    WSM->>Client: JSON {type: completed, progress: 100, questions_count: N}

    Note over Client,WSM: Клиент отключается после получения результата

    Client->>API: WS close
    API->>WSM: disconnect(client_id)
    WSM->>WSM: del active_connections[client_id]

    Note over Client,Redis: Альтернатива — HTTP опрос (если WS недоступен)
    Client->>API: GET /api/task/{task_id}
    API->>Redis: GET task:{task_id}
    Redis-->>API: {status, progress, current_step, result}
    API-->>Client: TaskStatus
